==English==

===Verb===
'''[[be]] [[all]] [[ears]]'''

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[listen]] [[carefully]] or [[eagerly]]; to [[anticipate]].
#: ''If you think you can suggest a better alternative to spending that much money, I '''am all ears'''.''

